@startuml docs/whiteboard/download-export-from-project-list.puml
title "User Downloads an Exported Video from the Project List"

actor User
participant "Browser"
participant "React Component"
participant "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)"
participant "API Route (/api/video-projects)"
database "Database (Prisma)"
participant "External (Object storage)"

== Export attached to a project (202) ==
User ->> Browser: Click "Export 1080p"
Browser ->> "React Component": onStartExport(quality)
"React Component" ->> "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": POST {projectId, quality, aspectRatio, project}
note right of "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": requireViewer()\nZod renderRequestSchema\nrequireProjectAccess(projectId, "read")\nassertExportResolution(org, quality)
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": renderJob.create({userId, projectId, status: rendering})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": {id}
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" -->> "React Component": {jobId}
note over "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": Worker renders, uploads MP4\nthen status = done, outputKey set

== List shows the download (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Open /workspace
Browser ->> "React Component": load projects
"React Component" ->> "API Route (/api/video-projects)": GET ?page&limit
note right of "API Route (/api/video-projects)": requireOrganizationRole()\ncanAct(role, "read")
"API Route (/api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": renderJob.findMany\nWHERE userId = viewer AND projectId IN page\nAND status = done AND outputKey NOT NULL\nAND createdAt >= now - 24h\nDISTINCT projectId ORDER BY createdAt DESC
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (/api/video-projects)": latest export per project
"API Route (/api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {data[].latestExport}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Show "Video" button on card / row
User ->> Browser: Click "Video"
Browser ->> "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": GET /{jobId}/file
note right of "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": job.userId must equal session user
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" ->> "External (Object storage)": getStream(outputKey)
"External (Object storage)" -->> Browser: video/mp4 attachment

== Edge Case: Unauthorized (401) ==
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" -->> "React Component": 401 no session

== Edge Case: Project not readable (404) ==
note right of "API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)": other org or deleted project\nanswers 404, never 403
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" -->> "React Component": 404 Not found

== Edge Case: Plan resolution exceeded (402/403) ==
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" -->> "React Component": billing error, showBillingNotice()

== Edge Case: Already rendering (429) ==
"API Route (/api/whiteboard/render)" -->> "React Component": 429 one export per user

== Edge Case: Expired or someone else's export (404) ==
note right of "API Route (/api/video-projects)": exports older than 24h or owned\nby another member are not listed
@enduml
